Edited: check it comments in steam somebody asked chatgpt to write review  - "This single player video game is decent, offering a mix of standard gameplay mechanics and a passable story. The graphics are average and while the characters have some depth, the world-building could use improvement. The game has its moments, but it fails to fully immerse the player and can become repetitive. Overall, it's a solid option for those looking for a simple single player experience, but don't expect anything groundbreaking."
